1
00:00:03,414 --> 00:00:05,614
(Sheldon:)How much will it hurt?

2
00:00:06,417 --> 00:00:07,687
(Amy:)It's just
a tiny skin sample.

3
00:00:07,685 --> 00:00:09,485
(Amy:)You saw me
do it to myself.

4
00:00:09,486 --> 00:00:12,426
(Sheldon:)On a scale of one to ten,
where one is a pebble

5
00:00:12,423 --> 00:00:15,323
(Sheldon:)in your shoe
and ten is the monkey

6
00:00:15,326 --> 00:00:18,126
(Sheldon:)you thought was your pet
biting your face off.

7
00:00:18,128 --> 00:00:19,828
(Amy:)A two.

8
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:22,330
(Sheldon:)Eating a whole Altoid?

9
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,270
(Amy:)Sheldon,

10
00:00:24,268 --> 00:00:25,968
(Amy:)if I'm gonna synthesize
a neural network

11
00:00:25,970 --> 00:00:27,900
(Amy:)from our skin cells,
I need to harvest them.

12
00:00:27,905 --> 00:00:30,475
(Amy:)Now, I've done this dozens
of times, but if you're

13
00:00:30,474 --> 00:00:32,004
(Amy:)too scared
you don't have to.

14
00:00:32,009 --> 00:00:33,879
(Sheldon:)No, this is for science.

15
00:00:33,877 --> 00:00:36,007
(Sheldon:)I can be brave
for science.

16
00:00:37,348 --> 00:00:39,318
(Amy:)Thank you.

17
00:00:39,316 --> 00:00:41,586
Oh, jiminy, that's cold!

18
00:00:41,585 --> 00:00:43,455
(Amy:)Just think how happy
you'll be in a few weeks

19
00:00:43,454 --> 00:00:44,824
(Amy:)when I've converted
our skin cells

20
00:00:44,822 --> 00:00:46,352
(Amy:)into functional
brain cells.

21
00:00:46,357 --> 00:00:50,057
(Sheldon:)All right, just warn me
before you do it.

22
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:52,490
(Amy:)Okay.

23
00:00:52,496 --> 00:00:54,126
(Amy:)Three...

24
00:00:54,131 --> 00:00:55,801
(Amy:)two...
and we're done.

25
00:00:58,469 --> 00:01:00,299
(Sheldon:)You tricked me.

26
00:01:00,304 --> 00:01:01,904
(Sheldon:)You didn't say one.

27
00:01:01,905 --> 00:01:03,835
(Amy:)It didn't hurt, did it?
No...

28
00:01:03,841 --> 00:01:06,071
but “three, two and we're done”
is incomplete.

29
00:01:06,076 --> 00:01:08,006
(Sheldon:)You know those
things bother me.

30
00:01:08,012 --> 00:01:09,612
(Sheldon:)It's like hearing
“da-da-da-da-da-dah”

31
00:01:09,613 --> 00:01:10,643
(Sheldon:)without yelling...

32
00:01:10,648 --> 00:01:12,318
(Amy:)Okay, fine, one.

33
00:01:12,316 --> 00:01:13,986
(Amy:)Thank you.

34
00:01:13,984 --> 00:01:16,914
Now yell “Charge” and
we can get out of here.

35
00:01:17,207 --> 00:01:20,607
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

